AiTask qa_w55_category_digest {
  label: "QA W57 Weekly Category Revenue Digest"
  description: "TEMP QA (nhi.ty, 2026-11-10): run test of write_ai_task_result. Safe to delete."
  brief: @md
    1. From @Dataset:ecommerce_official, get revenue by product category for last week (the last complete Monday–Sunday week) and the week before.
    2. Find the categories with the largest changes.
    3. Write a short digest of total revenue, its change, and each category's revenue and change. Write the result with the write_ai_task_result skill.

    Delivery: Post the digest to the Slack channel #nhity-test.
  ;;
  acceptance_criteria: @md
    - Covers exactly the last complete Monday–Sunday week and the week before.
    - Lists every category with its revenue and week-over-week change.
  ;;
}
